%% SYS-BEH13
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Seller as 卖家
  actor Buyer as 买家
  participant System as 交易平台
  participant Logistics as 物流模块
  Seller->>System: 对待发货订单确认发货
  System->>Logistics: 初始化并推进物流轨迹
  Logistics-->>Buyer: 展示运输进度
  alt 买家主动确认
    Buyer->>System: 确认收货
  else 到达后超时
    System->>System: 定时任务自动确认
  end
  System-->>Buyer: 订单进入待评价
